{"4362830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Back To Stables", "steam_appid": 4362830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>George wandered off. George belongs at home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>George is a curious, stubborn, easily distracted horse, and right now he is a long way from his stable. Your job is to bring him back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back to Stables is a cozy puzzle adventure across 25 hand-crafted levels of meadows, forests, and quiet countryside. Lure George with apples and carrots, work around the things that startle him, solve the small puzzles in his path, and dress him up in something fashionable for the journey home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362830/extras/15b2f0674473360845369a446578f45d.avif?t=1777538064\" alt=\"Lures\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >George <strong>loves </strong>apples and carrots. Use these to guide George in the right direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362830/extras/4c3291367fbf974e69b3347db758bc5c.avif?t=1777538064\" alt=\"Hazards\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Things that spook George</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >George is a sensitive soul. A bobcat in the bushes will send him bolting. Read the path ahead and steer him gently around what unsettles him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362830/extras/f69fa0cf2911c08b571fad56d333ad2c.avif?t=1777538064\" alt=\"Minigames\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes an easier and shorter path can be blocked, but with your assistance George can get through them by solving various minigames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362830/extras/ffbac27746809db22ed08f87218e855e.avif?t=1777538064\" alt=\"Customize\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the levels, George can find shiny Chests! Chests contain customization items, which can be equipped so George can trot along in a very fashionable way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362830/extras/5a6950faa4d9a335e27d59defe8990d0.avif?t=1777538064\" alt=\"Levels\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features 20 main story levels and 5 extra levels, which provide additional harder puzzles for players to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>George wandered off. George belongs at home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>George is a curious, stubborn, easily distracted horse, and right now he is a long way from his stable. Your job is to bring him back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back to Stables is a cozy puzzle adventure across 25 hand-crafted levels of meadows, forests, and quiet countryside. Lure George with apples and carrots, work around the things that startle him, solve the small puzzles in his path, and dress him up in something fashionable for the journey home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362830/extras/15b2f0674473360845369a446578f45d.avif?t=1777538064\" alt=\"Lures\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >George <strong>loves </strong>apples and carrots. Use these to guide George in the right direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362830/extras/4c3291367fbf974e69b3347db758bc5c.avif?t=1777538064\" alt=\"Hazards\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Things that spook George</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >George is a sensitive soul. A bobcat in the bushes will send him bolting. Read the path ahead and steer him gently around what unsettles him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362830/extras/f69fa0cf2911c08b571fad56d333ad2c.avif?t=1777538064\" alt=\"Minigames\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes an easier and shorter path can be blocked, but with your assistance George can get through them by solving various minigames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362830/extras/ffbac27746809db22ed08f87218e855e.avif?t=1777538064\" alt=\"Customize\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the levels, George can find shiny Chests! Chests contain customization items, which can be equipped so George can trot along in a very fashionable way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img